  "content": "\n\n![https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BzjQfCJW/images/cfe46db8bbb94021d24bcabe1e2d43b6414eebba.png](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BzjQfCJW/images/cfe46db8bbb94021d24bcabe1e2d43b6414eebba.png)\n\n## 簡介：\n\n此模組為您的末地維度添加了多種結構與地下城，豐富您的探索體驗。這些地下城設計有怪物生成器與藏有戰利品的箱子，提供資源及與環境互動的機會。\n\n- 喚魔者城堡\n- 高難度城堡\n- 高塔\n- 宮殿\n- 金字塔   \n\n## 探索更多精彩模組！\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better-village\"\n  title=\"下載 Better Villages - 改善 Minecraft 村莊\"\n  target=\"_blank\"\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  <img alt=\"Better Villages - 增強與改善 Minecraft 村莊\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/dGVX5JbJ/37fb0191b7d0da4db6440b5ceb705e3eea0e6e35_96.webp\" />\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/awesome-dungeon\"\n  title=\"下載 Awesome Dungeon - 探索 Minecraft 中的史詩地下城\"\n  target=\"_blank\"\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  <img alt=\"Awesome Dungeon - 全新結構與充滿戰利品的地下城\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ptzsjBKT/ab4804bc31f91f53a5ffadc52162f1ab4c967cb5_96.webp\" />\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/awesome-dungeon-nether\"\n  title=\"下載 Awesome Dungeon: Nether Edition - 危險的下界地下城\"\n  target=\"_blank\"\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  <img\n    alt=\"Awesome Dungeon Nether Edition - 在致命的下界地下城中生存\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gW1httFP/2b963bb4be8659f1f3492100aa9c48066ab699f0_96.webp\" />\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/awesome-dungeon-edition-ocean\"\n  title=\"下載 Awesome Dungeon: Ocean Edition - 水下地下城冒險\"\n  target=\"_blank\"\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  <img\n    alt=\"Awesome Dungeon Ocean Edition - 發現沉沒的地下城與寶藏\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/hn56Bq5n/0b21eff420e6c04c3820efebd77ab9bf2ee82d76_96.webp\" />\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/disable-new-world-creation-screen\"\n  title=\"停用新世界建立畫面 - 找回經典 Minecraft 世界選單\"\n  target=\"_blank\"\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n  <img\n    alt=\"停用新世界建立畫面 - 找回經典 Minecraft 世界選單\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/hpXiq9nb/6eb794a665a467ed7307803da1e26a1316f6a0